# Transient files `bench_agent_vision`'s result writer leaves in benchmarks/visual/:
# an flock target for concurrent sweeps (a full sweep is hours long, and the local
# arms need the GPU while the remote ones only need the network), and the temp file
# it renames into place so a crash mid-write cannot truncate the results.
*.json.tmp
benchmarks/visual/*.lock

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
